                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23f5e9b3-d678-3c7b-9f7e-8a431cfd23e3",
                        "entry_id": "1ba311aa-5578-3a78-a53b-0d73ccb11b84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. начинять, начинить"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "adf4eb50-7787-3b59-8c66-f484150b27e2",
                        "entry_id": "1ba311aa-5578-3a78-a53b-0d73ccb11b84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "результат такого действия; то, чем начинено что-либо (о чём-либо съедобном)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbd0561c-8215-48d2-8277-5c3a055eb44b",
                                "sense_id": "adf4eb50-7787-3b59-8c66-f484150b27e2",
                                "text": "К блинчатому караваю с начинкой из гречневой каши, творога, яиц и манных круп идут все почти подливки от N 320 до N 377, кроме горчичных."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d15a814a-1354-4449-8cd9-e54f0c34f8cf",
                                "sense_id": "adf4eb50-7787-3b59-8c66-f484150b27e2",
                                "text": "« .. байдановские пироги — огромные кулебяки с начинкой в двадцать ярусов, где было всё, начиная от слоя налимьей печёнки и кончая слоем костных мозгов»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41218048-039a-4ab3-aa2c-53ceacf269a7",
                                "sense_id": "adf4eb50-7787-3b59-8c66-f484150b27e2",
                                "text": "Положите на каждую лепёшку чайную ложку начинки (шоколадная паста, джем, паштет или творог). Сверните лепёшку с начинкой в рулет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c16c4f05-6687-4449-93da-5b915cd02e2e",
                                "sense_id": "adf4eb50-7787-3b59-8c66-f484150b27e2",
                                "text": "Молодой гусь (4–5 кг), пол-лимона, соль, свежемолотый чёрный перец, яблоки, чернослив и репчатый лук для начинки."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ef17c6c-b52f-3a21-a9ef-63e76ff80d61",
                        "entry_id": "1ba311aa-5578-3a78-a53b-0d73ccb11b84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. о том, что находится внутри чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8fca80e-492e-4aec-b7fb-94b52243c280",
                                "sense_id": "4ef17c6c-b52f-3a21-a9ef-63e76ff80d61",
                                "text": "Начинка из тюфяка, тоже не прибранная, густыми кучами лежала кругом."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb317c37-f853-307e-ab60-c275490d0ae0",
                        "entry_id": "1ba311aa-5578-3a78-a53b-0d73ccb11b84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., проф. о внутреннем оборудовании чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "575dc234-c20f-49db-b98b-cf170ecb549f",
                                "sense_id": "eb317c37-f853-307e-ab60-c275490d0ae0",
                                "text": "Начинка — Android Wear, процессор Snapdragon 400, 4 Гб встроенной и 512 Мб оперативной памяти, батарея 410 мАч."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d886580f-1a60-48ec-a3d4-7a515eae2f8e",
                                "sense_id": "eb317c37-f853-307e-ab60-c275490d0ae0",
                                "text": "Курчатов понимал, что быстрее и дешевле сделать атомную бомбу с плутониевой начинкой."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33d99a9d-5f66-4816-89bf-5b7932357377",
                                "sense_id": "eb317c37-f853-307e-ab60-c275490d0ae0",
                                "text": ".. с такой электронной начинкой корабль получался очень тяжёлым."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d18c8b95-4706-4097-9b03-f4cd2f2345e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "1ba311aa-5578-3a78-a53b-0d73ccb11b84",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие по значению гл. начинять, начинить",
                        "target_lang_word": "filling",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "filling",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a3bd2a5-c0a4-33f8-b7f4-7cf977eca2e5",
                                        "entry_id": "e4446f2e-169d-37fc-b0c5-ffcaf7bd3bf3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of fill"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "filling",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc77b6c0-c0c8-3bb0-b46b-09cea68b4508",
                                        "entry_id": "994a0b28-b1b6-32a5-acd8-2087de5c6f3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of food, that satisfies the appetite by filling the stomach."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40146994-e13c-4118-97b0-b95df4dfb700",
                                                "sense_id": "cc77b6c0-c0c8-3bb0-b46b-09cea68b4508",
                                                "text": "a filling meal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ec300e9-2468-4e05-93a6-338ca4f039a6",
                                                "sense_id": "cc77b6c0-c0c8-3bb0-b46b-09cea68b4508",
                                                "text": "We had oatmeal porridge for breakfast, which was fairly filling, but I always starved at lunch and dinner. My friend continually reasoned with me to eat meat, but I always pleaded my vow and then remained silent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73d6cbe2-970b-4788-af89-b0b912a50b17",
                                                "sense_id": "cc77b6c0-c0c8-3bb0-b46b-09cea68b4508",
                                                "text": "Plain and unexciting, perhaps, but they are solid, well cooked, appetising and filling, and moreover cheap."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "filling",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0da2139e-f9ff-3f4f-8924-64ac3d61177a",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is used to fill something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44fd0b09-66ac-3c52-8d8c-4ab6d2d2a7db",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The contents of a pie, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f2c1d35-6938-3643-af74-1ee6b0db4814",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any material used to fill a cavity in a tooth or the result of using such material."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d580669b-3cfd-4af4-8604-7025ef639f85",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2c1d35-6938-3643-af74-1ee6b0db4814",
                                                "text": "I will be using a rapid-setting cement filling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c20e29a-f498-4ea4-87ff-155f7ed88eb4",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2c1d35-6938-3643-af74-1ee6b0db4814",
                                                "text": "My temporary filling fell out and got lost."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2223ea1-6999-3ea8-add5-e6f63e235f1c",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The woof in woven fabrics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a520ee5-7155-38e9-8832-25a6a7441946",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prepared wort added to ale to cleanse it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adaa5d28-768c-3feb-92e4-6d306dd0c026",
                                        "entry_id": "8a353ec9-e41e-3026-b516-a7de7b8f9f3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A religious experience attributed to the Holy Ghost \\\"filling\\\" a believer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6670448-3a72-4f67-aac7-39f9d2f034e0",
                                                "sense_id": "adaa5d28-768c-3feb-92e4-6d306dd0c026",
                                                "text": "1903, William Edward Biederwolf, A Help to the Study of the Holy Spirit, James H. Earle & Company (publ.), page 100.\nAs learned Dr. Hodge has reminded us, any impartation of the Holy Spirit is a baptism, and certainly, apart from biblical phraseology, a filling with the Spirit may be called a baptism with the Spirit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8045c20-514e-49a4-8a2d-7aa6caf46343",
                                                "sense_id": "adaa5d28-768c-3feb-92e4-6d306dd0c026",
                                                "text": "All these terms referencing the work of the Holy Spirit—coming upon, falling upon, being filled with the Holy Spirit, receiving the promise of the Father—can best be understood as synonymous with baptism in the Holy Spirit, with the key to understanding being “one baptism, many fillings.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c13571a-53fa-4773-a9fb-7abf099676f5",
                                                "sense_id": "adaa5d28-768c-3feb-92e4-6d306dd0c026",
                                                "text": "Other signs followed their subsequent fillings with the Holy Spirit, but the first filling was immediately followed by the speaking in other tongues."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
